  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparing Local CSOs to Improve their Ability to Facilitate an eNabling Environment through Training and Service Delivery (PLANTS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project will contribute to an inclusive, participatory, empowered, and independent Belizean civil society. It will also promote an inclusive and open dialogue with and between CSOs at the local level. Furthermore, it will improve the ability of local civil society organizations to facilitate an enabling environment to increase service delivery on behalf of vulnerable communities in Toledo District in southern, Belize.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(&lt;strong&gt;Result 1&lt;/strong&gt;): establish a strategy to engage and increase collaboration among district-level service providers  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(&lt;strong&gt;Result 2&lt;/strong&gt;): enhance inclusive rural social service delivery via the establishment/improvement of community hubs &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(&lt;strong&gt;Result 3&lt;/strong&gt;): increase public awareness about existing services and access&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;These results will together improve the ability of local CSOs to facilitate an enabling environment to increase service delivery on behalf of vulnerable communities in the Toledo District &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The project includes digitalization and empowerment and focuses on women&#xbf;s empowerment, gender gender equality, and youth empowerment. It will support CSOs to strengthen their digital skills and reduce the digital gender gap and other gaps. The Action is aligned with human rights, SDG indicators, and the principles of the 2030 Agenda and will strengthen the capacities of rights-holders to make their claims, and of duty-bearers to meet their obligations. It includes an element of environmental protection and climate change, as it will collect and provide information on climate change on various topics such as recycling, conservation, natural resource management. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The project will include financial support to third parties.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
